Package: container-stack-tests
Architecture: all
Depends: ca-certificates, docker.io, ${misc:Depends}
Description: shared autopkgtest suite for the Ubuntu container stack
 This meta-package carries the autopkgtest suite that is run
 against the Ubuntu container stack: containerd-app, containerd-stable,
 docker-buildx, docker-compose-v2, docker.io-app, runc-app, and runc-stable.
